    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Night Prayer"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director: with stringed instruments. A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Answer me when I call,",
          "God, who vindicates me. ,",
          "You freed me from affliction;",
          "be gracious to me and hear my prayer."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How long, exalted ones, will my honor be insulted?",
          "How long will you love what is worthless",
          "and pursue a lie?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Know that the Lord has set apart",
          "the faithful for himself;",
          "the Lord will hear when I call to him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Be angry and do not sin;",
          "reflect in your heart while on your bed and be silent."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Offer sacrifices in righteousness ,",
          "and trust in the Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Many are asking, “Who can show us anything good? ”",
          "Let the light of your face shine on us, Lord."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have put more joy in my heart",
          "than they have when their grain and new wine abound."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will both lie down and sleep in peace,",
          "for you alone, Lord, make me live in safety."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
